5
00:02:10,664 --> 00:02:16,197
But that it was scaled up and became the new norm would in some way be very, very good.

6
00:02:16,197 --> 00:02:23,203
And it would also mean that climate emissions dropped dramatically as this entire resource sales -

7
00:02:23,203 --> 00:02:26,305
- As we do, a lot of resources cost.

8
00:02:26,305 --> 00:02:33,370
And then when we have used them, they suddenly become hopelessly mixed and we cannot benefit from them again.

9
00:02:33,370 --> 00:02:40,539
Instead of using them for as long as possible and finding ways to make sure we don't have to replace everything -

10
